.* JOB: the task menu for jobs.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='JOB'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=JOB HELP=HLPJOB KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Jobs
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKUSRJOB'.Work with jobs
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD WRKACTJOB'.Work with all active job statistics
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD WRKSPLF'.Work with spooled output files
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKWTR'.Work with printers
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD WRKJOBQ'.Work with job queues
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD WRKSBS'.Work with active subsystems
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?SBMJOB'.Submit a job
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='MENU JOBENV'.Control job environment
:MENUI OPTION=60 ACTION='MENU JOB2'.More job options
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDJOB'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPJOB.Jobs - Help
:P.Jobs, the queues they wait on, the subsystems they run in and the output
they leave. Option 60 shows more.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
